@startuml series-state-machine
!include common.iuml
[*] --> Created : NewSeries(host, guest, tc, bo)
state "Created" as Created
state "Ready" as Ready
state "InGame" as InGame
state "Finished" as Finished
Created --> Ready : both readied
Ready --> InGame : game 1 live
InGame --> InGame : RecordResult\nred passes to the loser, draws retain
InGame --> Finished : majority reached\nor schedule exhausted (plurality)
Created --> Finished : forfeit\ncharges every remaining game
InGame --> Finished : forfeit\ncharges every remaining game
Finished --> [*]
@enduml
